@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false

title Gratia - API Gateway Layer

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Frontend" as FE
rectangle "API Gateway" as APIGW

package "Microservices" {
    rectangle "auth_service" as AUTH
    rectangle "user_service" as USER
    rectangle "food_service" as FOOD
    rectangle "claim_service" as CLAIM
}

FE --> APIGW

APIGW --> AUTH
APIGW --> USER
APIGW --> FOOD
APIGW --> CLAIM

note right of APIGW
Responsibilities:
- Request Routing
- Authentication Validation
- Rate Limiting
- Centralized Access Point
- Request Logging
end note
@enduml